{"version":1,"key":"card:551","content":{"id":551,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回顾笔记的建议和实践："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"投入时间"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"很多人都觉得回顾很有必要性，但是都说没时间做，这明显是借口，因为不存在没时间，只存在优先级，还是没把这件事情作为重要的事情来对待。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入前，大致分好类之后，查阅相关类比的笔记，寻找联系，这是一个回顾的时机"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每日，隔日回顾，处理临时笔记，临时的想法，未消化的内容，未建立的新连接"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每周，每月回顾，这种长周期的回顾是为了发现笔记间的新联系，对笔记产生新思考后的重新归类"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"启动思考"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回顾并不是去背诵笔记的内容，而是在回顾笔记时启发思考，要启发思考最简单的办法就是问问题，举个例子："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对我现在正在解决的问题有什么帮助？"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我可以补充什么新的实践或新的思考？"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"和已有笔记的联系是什么？"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"进行互动"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回顾也是整理笔记的一个时机，当触发了新的思考时，或者有更深刻的理解时，也需要对已有的笔记进行修改，笔记不是一成不变的，而是在不断发展的（这也为输入减少了负担，我们不追求写下的笔记都是完美的，笔记应当是不断发展的）"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"增：新实践、新想法、新联系"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"改：非文法、语法上的修改或扩写，而是在理解消化后用自己的理解进行修改"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删：对于不在关注的领域，归档或者及时清理，减少心智负担，对于单篇笔记，有了更深刻的理解，可以使用更精炼的语句进行表达，删除不必要的部分"}]}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["读书/笔记的方法","学习方法"],"createTime":1743904829242,"updateTime":1743904847872,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743904847872}}